{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "6a8db5f2-1dc2-42f7-b461-6c13ed789c5d",
    "name": "Materials Service API",
    "description": "# 📚 TREEdu Backend APIs (Postman Version)\n\nHệ thống backend cho nền tảng học từ vựng tiếng Anh **TREEdu**, xây dựng theo kiến trúc Monolithic.\n\n---\n\n## 🧩 Tổng quan kiến trúc\n\n```\nClient (Web / Mobile)\n        |\n        v\nAuth Service (JWT, User, Role)\n        |\n        | Authorization: Bearer <JWT>\n        v\nMaterials Service (Flashcard, Word, Learning)\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n# 🔐 AUTH SERVICE API\n\n**Base URL**\n\n```\nhttp://localhost:3001/api\n\n ```\n\n## 🎯 Chức năng\n\n- Đăng ký & xác minh email\n    \n- Đăng nhập / đăng xuất\n    \n- Quản lý người dùng & phân quyền\n    \n- Cấp JWT cho service khác\n    \n\n---\n\n## 1\\. Authentication APIs\n\n### Register New Member\n\n**POST** `/users/newMember`\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"userType\": \"MEMBER\",\n  \"email\": \"testuser@gmail.com\",\n  \"fullName\": \"Test User\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n**Workflow**\n\n```\nRegister -> Verify Email -> Login\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### Login\n\n**POST** `/auth/login`\n\n``` json\n{\n  \"email\": \"testuser@gmail.com\",\n  \"password\": \"password123\"\n}\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n# 📦 MATERIALS SERVICE API\n\n**Base URL**\n\n```\nhttp://localhost:3002/api\n\n ```\n\n## 🎯 Chức năng\n\n- Quản lý Flashcard & Word\n    \n- Theo dõi tiến trình học\n    \n- Kiểm tra phát âm\n    \n\n---\n\n## Flashcard APIs\n\n### Create Flashcard\n\n**POST** `/flashcards`\n\nHeader:\n\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer <JWT>\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n### Get All Flashcards\n\n**GET** `/flashcards`\n\n**Phân quyền**\n\n```\nGUEST    -> SYSTEM\nMEMBER   -> SYSTEM + OWN\nADMIN    -> ALL\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n## Learning Workflow\n\n```\nRegister\n   ↓\nVerify Email\n   ↓\nLogin\n   ↓\nGet Flashcards\n   ↓\nStart Learning\n   ↓\nTrack Progress\n\n ```\n\n---\n\n© TREEdu Project",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "_exporter_id": "39562894",
    "_collection_link": "https://go.postman.co/collection/39562894-6a8db5f2-1dc2-42f7-b461-6c13ed789c5d?source=collection_link"
  },
